msgstr "Para sa mas malalim na pag-aaral ng AQC-Tensor Qiskit addon, tingnan ang tutorial na [Improved Trotterized Time Evolution with Approximate Quantum Compilation](/tutorials/approximate-quantum-compilation-for-time-evolution) o ang [qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor).\n"

